---
import SectionHeading from './SectionHeading.astro';
const root = import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
---
<section id="capabilities" class="section capabilities" aria-labelledby="capabilities-heading">
  <SectionHeading number="02" title="What I bring to a problem" id="capabilities-heading" note="How the vision becomes visible" />
  <p class="capabilities-point-of-view">I move from questions to structure, then to working interfaces people can inspect and respond to.</p>
  <div class="capabilities-grid">
    <article class="capability-card">
      <p class="micro">01 / Evaluate</p>
      <h3>Find where clarity breaks down.</h3>
      <p>I use evaluation and project research to identify where a workflow loses context—and separate observed evidence from questions still to test.</p>
      <div class="capability-links">
        <a href={`${root}work/d2l-redesign/#evaluation`}>D2L evaluation <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
        <a href={`${root}work/community-spaces/#research`}>Community research <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
      </div>
    </article>
    <article class="capability-card">
      <p class="micro">02 / Structure</p>
      <h3>Make the journey legible.</h3>
      <p>I connect information architecture, task flows, and interface states so people can see what matters and what their next action means.</p>
      <div class="capability-links">
        <a href={`${root}work/d2l-redesign/#experience`}>D2L student journey <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
        <a href={`${root}work/community-spaces/#experience`}>Community experience <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
      </div>
    </article>
    <article class="capability-card">
      <p class="micro">03 / Prototype</p>
      <h3>Make ideas inspectable.</h3>
      <p>I turn concepts into responsive prototypes and refine their interactions around accessibility, with keyboard access, reduced motion, and edge states in view.</p>
      <div class="capability-links">
        <a href={`${root}work/apple-ring/#implementation`}>Apple Ring implementation <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
        <a href={`${root}work/align/#decisions`}>ALIGN design decisions <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
      </div>
    </article>
  </div>
</section>
<style>
  .capabilities-point-of-view {
    max-width: 66ch;
    margin: 1.25rem 0 2rem 5rem;
    font: 400 clamp(1.45rem, 2.8vw, 2.25rem)/1.3 var(--font-editorial);
    letter-spacing: -.025em;
    text-wrap: balance;
  }
  .capabilities-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
    border-block: 1px solid var(--rule);
  }
  .capability-card {
    display: flex;
    min-width: 0;
    flex-direction: column;
    padding: 1.5rem clamp(1rem, 2.4vw, 2rem);
  }
  .capability-card + .capability-card { border-left: 1px solid var(--rule); }
  .capability-card > .micro { margin: 0; color: var(--muted); }
  .capability-card h3 {
    max-width: 18ch;
    margin: 1rem 0 .75rem;
    font: 400 clamp(1.5rem, 2.1vw, 2rem)/1.2 var(--font-editorial);
    letter-spacing: -.025em;
    text-wrap: balance;
  }
  .capability-card > p:not(.micro) { margin: 0; color: var(--muted); }
  .capability-links {
    display: grid;
    gap: .25rem;
    margin-top: auto;
    padding-top: 1.5rem;
  }
  .capability-links a {
    display: inline-flex;
    width: fit-content;
    max-width: 100%;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    min-height: 44px;
    align-items: center;
    gap: .5rem;
    color: var(--ink);
    overflow-wrap: anywhere;
    text-underline-offset: .25em;
  }
  .capability-links a:focus-visible { outline: 3px solid var(--ink); outline-offset: 4px; }
  @media (max-width: 48rem) {
    .capabilities-point-of-view { margin-left: 2.5rem; }
    .capabilities-grid { grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr); }
    .capability-card { padding: 1.25rem 0; }
    .capability-card + .capability-card { border-left: 0; border-top: 1px solid var(--rule); }
    .capability-card h3 { max-width: 24ch; }
  }
  @media (max-width: 40rem) {
    .capabilities-point-of-view { margin-left: 0; font-size: 1.45rem; }
    .capability-links { padding-top: 1rem; }
  }
</style>
